e for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le09ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Simple Present Vs. Simple Past"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Simple Present tense to talk about a routine or a specific action that happens regularly. You use the Simple Present to describe a scene, or give personal information.<br><br>You use the Simple Past tense to talk about a finished event or a specific time in the past. You use expressions of time like <span class=\"italic\">last week</span>, <span class=\"italic\"> in 2009</span> or <span class=\"italic\">2 days ago.</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I work as a tour operator.<br>  <br>I live on the coast.<br>  <br>I enjoy scuba diving.</span><br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I worked on a cruiseship until last week.<br> <br>I lived in cold weather for too long!<br> <br>I enjoyed scuba diving in Costa Rica five days ago.</span><br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Where do you work?</span><br>  <br> <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Does he live near the coast?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Where did he work last summer?</span><br>  <br> <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Did they live near the coast when they were young?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I don't work here.</span><br>  <br> <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> She doesn't enjoy diving.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I didn't work here last year.</span><br>  <br> <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> He didn't enjoying diving last year.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to relocate "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to move to a new place "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I relocated to Belize last year."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you start talking to a stranger."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tropical "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "related to hot and humid weather"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Belize has a variety of tropical plants and animals."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "paradise"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an ideal place; the perfect holiday destination "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This beach is a tropical paradise!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tour operator "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who organizes tourist activities. "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I work as a tour operator."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "snorkeling"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "swimming below the water surface with a mask and a tube "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I enjoy snorkeling. There is so much to see underwa!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to provide "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to supply; to make available for use "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We provide everything you need for snorkeling."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to grow tired of"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to become bored with something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I grew tired of London and its gray skies."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob05aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue (5-8 lines) on your conversation with a fellow traveler."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Think of a coincidence, something interesting you find out about your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use Simple Present and Simple Past tenses to give personal information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your dialogue to the class."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue starting a conversation with a stranger."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share personal information in the dialogue. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I report about things actions and events in the past."}]}], "type": "sena"}